{"id":2868,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为了帮助2025级研究生快速适应研究生阶段学习生活，精准把握学术发展方向，明确毕业核心要求，软件学院于10月22日举行2025级研究生新生入学教育。</p><p>&nbsp; 活动由强彦院长、付东来副院长主讲。会上，强彦院长结合学科培养定位与学术规范，对学硕和专硕的毕业条件展开了详细讲解，并且鼓励同学们认真钻研，积极主动配合导师完成科研工作。他从科研课题参与到学术论文发表等关键节点逐一拆解，让同学们对“实践能力+学术表达”的毕业逻辑有了清晰认知。付东来副院长指出毕业条件只是学业合格的“最低标准”，而非个人成长的“最高标准”，他勉励全体新生要志存高远，主动迎难而上，将达成毕业要求视为起点，在未来的科研探索与专业实践中锤炼真本领，努力成长为一名“可靠顶用”的高层次优秀人才。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PozNYDUzLsM8C4M4llZnRrVLmlYnmU8sMz7bMm6fL7UbMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0oky4nSysLSysUN7aMlLbU4Vknm74nzTVL8MfUlC4nmvaMzrFU4VVUzLao7VFU4W2UYb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7aMzGJqdinx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11050&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/83E717BA05C9C1BF13E9E3CAAF3F7055/C1EA308A/C2FC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 553px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PozNYDUzLsM8C4M4llZnRrVLmlYnmU8sMz7bMm6fL7UbMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0oky4nSysLSysUN7aMlLbU4Vknm74nzTVL8MfUlC4nmvaMzrFU4VVUzLao7VFU4W2UYb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7aMzGJqdinx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11050&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PM8-Y4LzN8M4nfM4RLDMlLYozN8LRM8RLRWRLmTRL4TkLl-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZn1yaL1yYnRUsMlrfUmNDMlM2n7n7LmCsUmN4Lz7soRAFU4Q2LlUDLRQFLz9DnmlJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PLRlagtA8pUicc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11050&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F8F022D475EAB965CFDDD267B9311788/C6F1D606/186F5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 560px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PM8-Y4LzN8M4nfM4RLDMlLYozN8LRM8RLRWRLmTRL4TkLl-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZn1yaL1yYnRUsMlrfUmNDMlM2n7n7LmCsUmN4Lz7soRAFU4Q2LlUDLRQFLz9DnmlJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PLRlagtA8pUicc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11050&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br><br></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PozNYDUzLsM8C4M4llZnRrVLmlYnmU8sMz7bMm6fL7UbMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0oky4nSysLSysUN7aMlLbU4Vknm74nzTVL8MfUlC4nmvaMzrFU4VVUzLao7VFU4W2UYb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7aMzGJqdinx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11050&e=.jpg"}